@ViewerEditor
$Viewer & Editor Keys
Editor:
  F2            - Save
  F3            - Toggle word wrap
  F5            - Toggle show whitespaces
  F7            - Search
  Ctrl+Left     - Previous word boundary
  Ctrl+Right    - Next word boundary
  Ctrl+Shift+Left/Right - Select by words
  Ctrl+Y        - Delete line
  Ctrl+Z        - Undo
  Ctrl+Shift+Z  - Redo
  Ctrl+A        - Select all
  Esc / F10     - Exit

Viewer:
  F2            - Toggle wrap
  F4            - Toggle hex mode
  F7            - Search
  Esc / F10     - Exit

@PanelNav
$Panel Navigation
  Tab           - Switch active panel
  Alt+F1/F2     - Left/Right drive menu
  Ctrl+O        - Toggle panels / terminal view
  Ctrl+Tab      - Cycle workspaces
  Ctrl+W        - Close workspace
  Ctrl+N        - Fork active panel to new workspace
  Insert        - Select file/folder
  Ctrl+A        - View file attributes
  Alt+F7        - Find file
  Alt+F8        - Command history
  Alt+F12       - Folders history
  F11           - Plugin menu